@startuml
title Open-ChatBot System Architecture – Context Diagram
header Version 1.0 | Author: Antigravity AI | Date: 2026-06-26
left header {req: RF-ALL} | {uc: UC-ALL}
footer C4-CONTEXT-01 | Architecture Context

node "User Device (Localhost)" {
    component "Frontend UI (React/Vite)" as Frontend
    component "Backend API (FastAPI)" as Backend
    database "SQLite DB (chatbot.db)" as DB
    node "Llama.cpp Engine" {
        component "Consolidated Llama.cpp Server\n(Inference & Embeddings)" as LlamaServer
    }
}

actor "User" as User

User --> Frontend : Interacts (UI)
Frontend --> Backend : REST API (JSON)
Backend --> DB : SQLAlchemy (CRUD)
Backend --> LlamaServer : HTTP (Generation & Vectorization)

@enduml
